list.item:
Bhutto, Zulfikar Ali, Minister for
                        Industries, Natural Resources and Works of Pakistan until January 1963;
                        Foreign Minister from February 1963

person.note:
Under Secretary of State, January-December 1961; Special Represent-ative and
                    Adviser on African, Asian, and Latin American Affairs, December 1961-May 1963;
                    Ambassador to India from July 1963

Deputy Executive Secretary of the Department of State, August 1961-May 1962;
                    Special Assistant to the Secretary of State and Executive Secretary, May
                    1962-July 1963; thereafter Member of the National Security Council Staff
